        "title": "Serenity and Chaos at the same time",
        "text": "A visit to Pashupati Temple in Kathmandu is an absolute MUST. This is a busy place with many different things to see and experience. I was amazed how on one level I felt as if I was part of the process involved with families dealing with the death of their loved ones contrasted with the cheeky monkeys who run around ready to snatch anything you might have. These two things happen side by side so you experience the emotion of  life and death  at the same time.It is a place you can take time to reflect on what is really important in life, and it is quite moving to see the rituals involved around death and yet this is a happy place to visit. \nGo and visit and just see what comes up for you.",
